{"t_ms": 4284281, "conversation_id": "conv_immediate_s1_002", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Late Check-out Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nLate check-out is available upon request and depends on room availability. Guests checking out between 11:00 AM and 2:00 PM may be charged a partial room rate. Check-outs after 2:00 PM are generally charged as a full night's stay. Guests are advised to contact the Front Desk at least one day in advance to request a late check-out.", "Check-in Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nStandard check-in time is 2:00 PM. Guests are required to present a valid government-issued photo ID and the booking confirmation at the reception. A refundable security deposit may be collected during check-in, depending on the room category. Early check-in is subject to room availability and hotel policies. Guests arriving before the standard check-in time may request luggage storage free of charge while waiting for their room.\n", "Check-out Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nStandard check-out time is 11:00 AM. Guests wishing to extend their stay should contact the Front Desk before check-out. Late check-out may be available based on occupancy and may incur additional charges. Before leaving, guests are requested to return the room key and settle any outstanding charges such as minibar usage, laundry, or room service."], "scores": [0.4854634702205658, 0.49829697608947754, 0.5154590010643005], "filenames": ["04_late_checkout.txt", "01_checkin_policy.txt", "02_checkout_policy.txt"], "timing_policy": "immediate", "timing_trigger": "immediate", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": -71, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 71, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
